# A Crew Dragon from lift-off to docking with the ISS and home again, followed at warp (2026-10-20, issue
# 20261020_214759; CLAUDE.md Launches > "Crew spacecraft fly as their own objects"). Follow rides the stack, the upper
# stage, then the spacecraft from its separation (the handover), through the phasing burns, the approach and its holds,
# docked, then undocking, the deorbit, the entry and the splashdown. `launch state` -> crew_vehicles at each step.
#   python tools/harness/run.py tools/harness/scripts/crew_rendezvous.satcmd
time set 2027-08-30T11:00:00Z
wait 5
launch crew station=International event=launch lead=20 follow=1
wait 40
capture cr00_liftoff
time scale 1m
wait 600
state cr01_after_sep
capture cr01_after_sep
missions milestone list
time scale 1h
wait 240
state cr02_phasing
capture cr02_phasing
# the approach at 1x from its start (the jump keeps Go to on the spacecraft)
launch crew station=International event=arrive lead=-120 follow=1
wait 60
capture cr03_far
launch crew station=International event=hold400 lead=-60 follow=1
follow offset=-60,-260,40
follow aim=sat
wait 60
capture cr04_hold400
launch crew station=International event=hold20 lead=-60 follow=1
follow offset=-20,-60,10
follow aim=sat
wait 60
capture cr05_hold20
launch crew station=International event=dock lead=30 follow=1
time scale 10x
wait 300
state cr06_docked
follow offset=-10,-45,12
follow aim=sat
wait 30
capture cr06_docked
missions milestone next
wait 30
missions milestone list
# undocking six months on, then home at warp
launch crew station=International event=undock lead=60 follow=1
follow offset=-10,-45,12
follow aim=sat
time scale 10x
wait 900
state cr07_backout
capture cr07_backout
time scale 1m
wait 2000
state cr08_departed
launch crew station=International event=entry lead=-150 follow=1
wait 60
capture cr09_entry
launch crew station=International event=splash lead=120 follow=1
follow offset=-30,-80,20
follow aim=sat
wait 60
capture cr10_chutes
launch state
launch check
